.aspx"},{"c":"ENTG 2019 Q1","e":"entg","d":"2019-04-25","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Paretosh Misra","x":"In other words, if you have any dollar impact for 2019 due to tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/04/26/entegris-entg-q1-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"ENTG 2019 Q1","e":"entg","d":"2019-04-25","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Greg Graves","x":"GAAP operating expenses of $130 million included approximately $19 million of deal-related costs associated with the Versum transaction, $19 million of amortization of intangible assets, $3 million of integration costs and $2 million in severance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/04/26/entegris-entg-q1-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"ENTG 2019 Q1","e":"entg","d":"2019-04-25","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Greg Graves","x":"I noted that we had a couple million of severance in the quarter so we did make some headcount reductions in the quarter that will result in annualized savings of approximately $5 million.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/04/26/entegris-entg-q1-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"ENTG 2019 Q2","e":"entg","d":"2019-07-25","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Bertrand Loy","x":"To that end, we are implementing organizational changes that will enable us to be more responsive to our customers, increase our competitiveness and allow for scalable growth as well as result and significant cost savings.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/25/entegris-entg-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"ENTG 2019 Q2","e":"entg","d":"2019-07-25","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Bertrand Loy","x":"These changes are focused on streamlining the organization and optimizing our customer engagement model.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/25/entegris-entg-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"ENTG 2019 Q2","e":"entg","d":"2019-07-25","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Bertrand Loy","x":"Finally, we expect 2019 to be a record year for Entegris, and we are reaffirming our annual guidance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/25/entegris-entg-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"ENTG 2019 Q3","e":"entg","d":"2019-10-24","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Greg Graves","x":"Moving on to gross margins, GAAP gross margin was 43.2% and included the negative impact of approximately 5 million from an inventory write-up associated with the recent acquisitions and restructuring cost.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/25/entegris-entg-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"ENTG 2019 Q3","e":"entg","d":"2019-10-24","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Greg Graves","x":"GAAP operating expenses were 118 million, included a total of approximately 31 million from amortization of intangible assets, restructuring costs, integration costs and transaction fees associated with the MPD and Anow transactions.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/25/entegris-entg-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"ENTG 2019 Q4","e":"entg","d":"2020-02-04","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"David Silver","x":"Painting with a fairly broad brush here, but would I be correct to say that the fourth quarter reflects the ramp-up of production of kind of the leading-edge nodes at your customers, let's say, as opposed to the start-up of new fabs or price increases or something like that?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/04/entegris-entg-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"ENTG 2020 Q1","e":"entg","d":"2020-04-21","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Bertrand Loy","x":"While our order book remain healthy and we remain optimistic about the long-term growth of the industry, with millions of people getting laid off and shelter in place ordinances in various countries, we believe economic realities will catch up to semiconductor demand at some point this year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/24/entegris-entg-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"ENTG 2020 Q1","e":"entg","d":"2020-04-21","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Greg Graves","x":"GAAP operating expenses were approximately $105 million in Q1 and included a total of approximately $19 million of non-GAAP items from amortization of intangible assets, restructuring, deal and transaction costs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/24/entegris-entg-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"ENTG 2020 Q2","e":"entg","d":"2020-07-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Gregory B. Graves","x":"GAAP operating expenses were approximately $113 million in Q2 and included a total of approximately $17 million of non-GAAP items, from amortization of intangible assets, restructuring and other costs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/23/entegris-inc-entg-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"ENTG 2021 Q1","e":"entg","d":"2021-04-27","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Bertrand Loy","x":"So, we at least [Phonetic] need to increase our guidance for the year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/27/entegris-inc-entg-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ENTG 2021 Q4","e":"entg","d":"2022-02-01","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Bertrand Loy","x":"I think we mentioned that in the previous call that we were in the process of taking a close look at some of the input cost increases and trying to base between what was transient and it was more permanent in nature and to take appropriate measure to offset that with targeted price increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/02/01/entegris-entg-q4-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ENTG 2021 Q4","e":"entg","d":"2022-02-01","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Bertrand Loy","x":"I think there was a view early in 2021 that are not of the input price increases that we saw were mostly transient.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/02/01/entegris-entg-q4-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ENTG 2022 Q1","e":"entg","d":"2022-04-26","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Bertrand Loy","x":"We mentioned last year that we selectively decided to increase our prices to offset some of the more permanent price increases that we were seeing in some of the raw materials that we are using in our manufacturing processes.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/04/27/entegris-entg-q1-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ENTG 2022 Q1","e":"entg","d":"2022-04-26","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Bertrand Loy","x":"We are increasing our 2022 guidance, and we now expect revenue to grow 18% to 20%, which reflects a combination of stronger market growth and greater market outperformance for Entegris.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/04/27/entegris-entg-q1-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ENTG 2022 Q2","e":"entg","d":"2022-08-02","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Greg Graves","x":"As you'll recall, we didn't do across-the-board increases but only increased prices where there were -- where we saw increases in our own inputs, but we've certainly benefited from those price increases the past several quarters.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/08/02/entegris-entg-q2-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ENTG 2025 Q4","e":"entg","d":"2026-02-10","l":"ai_spend","r":"analyst","s":"Bhavesh Lodaya","x":"And we don't see a week go by without news of higher and higher CapEx spend in AI.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/10/entegris-entg-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ENTG 2026 Q1","e":"entg","d":"2026-04-30","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"David Reeder","x":"And then we view that as being offset, however, by power management, data center-related strength and then other ancillary AI-related strength.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/30/entegris-entg-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"ENTG 2026 Q1","e":"entg","d":"2026-04-30","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"David Reeder","x":"So strength in kind of AI-related and data center-related products, but memory availability potentially being a concern.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/30/entegris-entg-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"ENTG 2026 Q1","e":"entg","d":"2026-04-30","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"David Reeder","x":"CapEx-driven revenue decreased modestly year-over-year in the first quarter, mostly driven by accelerating order patterns in the prior year quarter in response to tariff actions.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/30/entegris-entg-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"ENTG 2026 Q1","e":"entg","d":"2026-04-30","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"David Reeder","x":"…you look at the first quarter performance, that modest decline was largely driven by some of the CapEx-related businesses that were down double digits, largely reflecting some dislocated order patterns that were in the first half of last year related to tariffs, as Jeff mentioned in his script.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/30/entegris-entg-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"ENTG 2026 Q1","e":"entg","d":"2026-04-30","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"David Reeder","x":"We do have, for some key suppliers, we do have some contractual terms with respect to price increases as well as our long-term agreements with them to take a certain amount of volumes.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/30/entegris-entg-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"ENTG 2026 Q1","e":"entg","d":"2026-04-30","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Bhavesh Lodaya","x":"And then do your contracts with your customers building just a simple pass-through of these costs?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/30/entegris-entg-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"ENTG 2026 Q2","e":"entg","d":"2026-08-06","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"David Reeder","x":"The second quarter was another strong quarter for Entegris as we continued to capitalize on accelerating AI-driven demand and the significant and growing investment across the semiconductor ecosystem.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/11/entegris-entg-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ENTG 2026 Q2","e":"entg","d":"2026-08-06","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"David Reeder","x":"We continue to see customers accelerate investments to support AI infrastructure with increasing activity across advanced logic, HBM memory and advanced packaging ecosystems.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/11/entegris-entg-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ENTG 2026 Q2","e":"entg","d":"2026-08-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"David Reeder","x":"Additionally, we announced plans to close our Logan, Utah facility, our third dilutive facility rationalization since late 2025, further streamlining our manufacturing footprint without impacting availability for our core semiconductor market.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/11/entegris-entg-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ENTG 2026 Q3","e":"entg","d":"2026-10-29","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"David Reeder","x":"Demand remains strong across advanced logic, advanced memory and throughout the semiconductor ecosystem, supported by continued investment in AI infrastructure.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/29/entegris-entg-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"}],"trends":{"theater":[[36,1,5632,0,0,0,4479,842],[37,1,5576,0,0,0,4289,1012],[38,1,6478,0,0,0,4725,1407],[39,1,6739,0,0,0,4582,1814],[40,1,7060,0,0,0,5140,1589],[41,1,7475,0,0,